  <data key="d11">A Resolution of the City Commission confirming the appointments of Gonzalo Sanabria (Nominated by the Gables by the Sea Homeowners' Association), Eileen Higgins Faradji (Nominated by the Hammock Oaks Homeowners' Association), Robert Martinez (Nominated by the Journeys End Homeowners' Association), Toni Schrager (Old Cutler Bay Homeowners' Association), and Alex Quevedo (Nominated by the Snapper Creek Lakes Club) to serve as members of the South Waterways Homeowners' Associations Advisory Board, for a two (2) year term which began on June 1, 2023 and continues through May 31, 2025.</data>
